# Configuration profiles often contain personal data (DNS tokens, device names,
# signing certs). Keep them OUT of the repo — drop your own .mobileconfig files
# here locally and the setup will auto-discover them.
*.mobileconfig
!.gitignore
!README.md
# Exception: gatekeeper.mobileconfig is tracked — it's needed to disable
# Gatekeeper on a fresh machine (macOS 26 has no CLI way) and holds no secrets.
!gatekeeper.mobileconfig
